OL,3,GNEWSA'We need to save water tower
OL,4,Abefore it's too late'
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water said it was "currently
OL,7,Fundertaking a specialist structural
OL,8,Fsurvey to assess the requirements to
OL,9,Fmaintain the tower to a continued safe
OL,10,Fstandard and the costs associated with
OL,11,Fthis".
